#: templates/orion/mcp/key_created.html:10
msgid ""
"Copy the key now. It is shown only once: afterwards only its first "
"characters are kept, and if it is lost the key must be revoked and a new one"
" made."
msgstr ""
"Copiar la clave ahora. Se muestra una sola vez: después solo se guardan sus "
"primeros caracteres, y si se pierde hay que revocarla y crear otra."

